{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":489019,"name":"Yael","username":"y123","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/y/bc79bd/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-11T14:01:48.634Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot lost connection to its Agent Computer immediately after one of my bots tried to set up a VPN \u003cem\u003eon that computer\u003c/em\u003e. Every bot on the account now fails to reconnect, including on phone. The main assistant no longer appears in the phone app roster.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI understand now that a VPN inside the Agent Computer is unsupported because it breaks the always-on path back to Cursor’s servers. I cannot ask a bot to uninstall the VPN, because no bot can reach the machine.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBot on the shared Agent Computer started setting up a VPN / changing network settings.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eConnection dropped right after that.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDesktop and phone both show reconnect / “can’t reach Grok Bot’s computer.”\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOther bots on the same account also cannot reach the computer.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMain bot is missing from the phone roster.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat I already tried\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRetry reconnect\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFully quit / relaunch Grok Bot\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChecked from phone as well as desktop\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEnvironment\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOS: \u003cstrong\u003eMacOS\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVPN that caused this: installed \u003cstrong\u003einside the Agent Computer by the bot\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease repair or reattach the existing Agent Computer from the backend. Reinstall the VPN.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUninstall the VPN and restore default routing/DNS\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDelete any routine/script that installs a VPN\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdd a standing rule: never install VPN/proxy or change DNS/network settings\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor / Grok Bot?\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes — Grok Bot is unusable until the Agent Computer is reachable again.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-09-11T14:01:57.583Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":7,"reads":3,"readers_count":2,"score":35.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":171357,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-agent-computer-unreachable-after-bot-installed-a-vpn-all-bots-fail-to-reconnect","display_username":"Yael","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":137332,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-agent-computer-unreachable-after-bot-installed-a-vpn-all-bots-fail-to-reconnect/171357/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accep